  "label": "User projected onto the textual punchline addressing 'your mom'",
  "description": "The user is projected onto the textual material 'your mom' in the meme's punchline, which uses the deictic 'your' to directly address the viewer. This creates an implicit 'you' as the recipient of the joke, making the user feel personally addressed in the context of the scenario described. The projection is onto the textual material, which frames the user as the person whose mom is being referenced in the humorous, potentially demeaning scenario.",
